{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"fc18654526bbb0a4d318f7e59fcc54d19c87fb56fcf2be4542bb53d1ea6eeed3"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:6860703541b29b30b74be8cbc01dd21a2d98357daca3fd4a1e8fcc3dcdfd5b85","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"17 July 2023","evidence":"[D7:1 | 4:33 pm on 12 July, 2023] Caroline: Hey Mel, great to chat with you again! So much has happened since we last spoke - I went to an LGBTQ conference two days ago and it was really special. I got the chance to meet and connect with people who've gone through similar journeys. It was such a welcoming environment and I felt totally accepted. I'm really thankful for this amazing community - it's shown me how important it is to fight for trans rights and spread awareness.","itemId":"urn:uuid:08d934af-e49b-5c75-a036-810862d7492c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:2911d715bd2ff227fa07f72db9b4acd7c3873c86c2c5752ed5100186c1fd94f4","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Caroline go to the LGBTQ conference?","referenceAnswer":"10 July 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"2911d715bd2ff227fa07f72db9b4acd7c3873c86c2c5752ed5100186c1fd94f4"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}